SUMMARY:Government Affairs Committee meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T060000
UID:ab1359fad5cb8ce44e879c99da9aa8d0@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:MISSION The mission of the Wake Forest Chamber’s Government 
 Affairs Committee (GAC) is to promote business and economic vitality throu
 gh effective public policy development and advocacy\, consistent with the 
 Chamber Board's strategic direction. This monthly meeting is free and open
  to all Chamber members. PURPOSE The purpose of the GAC revolves around th
 e following: ● Identifying and understanding issues impacting business a
 nd the local economy. ● Developing policies and positions that guide Cha
 mber advocacy on issues. ● Build action plans and advocate for Chamber p
 olicies and positions. Our standing monthly meeting will include updates o
 n legislation affecting our business community\, guest speakers\, local of
 ficials\, town updates\, and development of the Chamber's legislative agen
 da.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/government-
 affairs-committee-meeting-06-09-2026
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
