BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:78th State of The Chamber
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T180000
UID:8abfabe3b1a6026d913d3a08d3ed4bee@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The 78th Annual State of the Chamber is our premier evening- a
 n elevated celebration of the very best of Wake Forest's business communit
 y. With a refined atmosphere and a subtle nod to emerald elegance\, the ni
 ght centers on honoring the individuals and organizations whose leadership
  and impact continue to move our community forward. The evening unfolds wi
 th a beautifully staged cocktail reception- designed for connection\, conv
 ersation\, and a first toast- followed by our Taste of the Forest dinner a
 nd a polished awards program recognizing this year's standout leaders. Thi
 s is the Chamber's event of the year- where recognition meets experience a
 t the highest level. Join us.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/78th-state-
 of-the-chamber
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
