BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Series: Data Driven Decision Making with AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260616T103000
UID:136b974102897556a88dc63d7938078c@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Good decisions start with clear\, usable data. Join i90 founde
 r Will Mendoza for a practical session exploring how AI-powered tools can 
 help nonprofits and small businesses collect\, organize\, analyze\, and vi
 sualize data to support smarter\, faster decision-making. Participants wil
 l learn how businesses across North Carolina are using dashboards\, foreca
 sting tools\, and AI-supported insights to identify trends\, uncover oppor
 tunitites\, and guide strategy- without needing a data science background.
  You'll learn how to: Collect and organize business data for analysis Visu
 alize key metrics and performance trends Use AI-supported forecasting to i
 nform decisions
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-d
 ata-driven-decision-making-with-ai
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Series: AI in E-Commerce & Customer Retention
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260714T050000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260714T063000
UID:747f32db03e97f475dee4d3921acd0e3@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:In today's competitive online marketplace\, retaining customer
 s is just as important as acquiring them. This session explores how AI can
  help e-commerce businesses better understand customer behavior and create
  more personalized\, timely engagement. Participamts will learn how AI-dri
 ven tools can support product recommendations\, predict customer churn\, a
 nd segment audiences for targeted communication. The focus is on practical
  applications that strengthen relationships and drive repeat business.
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-a
 i-in-e-commerce-customer-retention
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Series: AI for Finance and Budget Optimization
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T103000
UID:9170e21f09c7feccbd57324fb3d7a765@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Financial clarity is essential for sustainable growth. This se
 ssion explores how AI tools can support smarter budgeting\, forecasting\, 
 and financial decision-making- without replacing professional oversight. P
 articipants will learn how AI can help predict cash flow\, analyze pricing
  strategies\, and categorize expenses to uncover trends and opportunities.
  The focus is on using data to improve visibility\, plan ahead\, and make 
 more informed financial choices. You'll leran how to: Use AI to support ca
 sh flow forecasting Analyze pricing and expenses more effectively Improve 
 budget planning and financial insight
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-a
 i-for-finance-and-budget-optimization
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
