 onal health\, or overall well-being\, our panelists will share their exper
 tise and perspectives in a welcoming and educational setting. Event Schedu
 le: 8:30 AM – Check-in and breakfast open 9:00 AM – Panel discussion b
 egins promptly 10:30 AM – Formal program concludes 10:30–11:00 AM – 
 Optional networking and opportunity for follow-up questions with panelists
  This event is a wonderful opportunity to connect with fellow women in our
  community\, gain practical health insights\, and engage directly with
